1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,687
Hello, little explorer! Ready for ten new letters? Today we'll learn G, H, I, J, K, L, M, N, O, and P. Look, listen, and say the words with me!

2
00:00:11,887 --> 00:00:18,839
